    <!-- ================= GRAVEL PATCH ================= -->
    <!-- Many small stones in ONE model with one link: a hundred separate models
         would cost a hundred broadphase entries for no extra fidelity. Heights are
         drawn in [0.012, 0.045] m, straddling rough_warn 0.010 and rough_max 0.040,
         and every one is below step_warn so the STEP test stays quiet and the
         ROUGHNESS test is what responds. Roughness is graded-only in terrain.yaml:
         this patch must become expensive, never impassable. -->
